<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>𝐍𝐞𝐱𝐮𝐬 𝐁𝐨𝐭 Commands</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: #0e1117;
            color: #e4e6eb;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #7289da;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .section {
            background: #1c1f26;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .section h2 {
            color: #7289da;
        }
        a {
            color: #7289da;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>𝐍𝐞𝐱𝐮𝐬 𝐁𝐨𝐭 Commands</h1>
    <a href="/">← Back to Dashboard</a>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>⛊ Moderation</h2>
        <p><b>n/kick @user &lt;reason&gt;</b> — Kick a member</p>
        <p><b>n/ban @user &lt;reason&gt;</b> — Ban a member</p>
        <p><b>n/unban &lt;user_id&gt;</b> — Unban a user</p>
        <p><b>n/timeout @user &lt;minutes&gt; &lt;reason&gt;</b> — Timeout a member</p>
        <p><b>n/removetimeout @user</b> — Remove a timeout</p>
        <p><b>n/mute @user &lt;reason&gt;</b> — Mute a member</p>
        <p><b>n/unmute @user</b> — Unmute a member</p>
        <p><b>n/warn @user &lt;reason&gt;</b> — Warn a member</p>
        <p><b>n/clear &lt;amount&gt;</b> — Clear messages</p>
        <p><b>n/setupapp #channel &lt;title&gt; - &lt;questions&gt;</b> — Create an application form</p>
        <p><b>n/openapp [@user]</b> — Apply for a role or membership</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>⚙︎ Channel</h2>
        <p><b>n/slowmode &lt;seconds&gt;</b> — Set slowmode delay</p>
        <p><b>n/lock</b> — Lock the current channel</p>
        <p><b>n/unlock</b> — Unlock the channel</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>𐀪 Roles</h2>
        <p><b>n/addrole @user @role</b> — Give a member a role</p>
        <p><b>n/removerole @user @role</b> — Remove a member’s role</p>
        <p><b>n/rolecatalog</b> — View all roles</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>𝒊 Info</h2>
        <p><b>n/userinfo @user</b> — Show user info</p>
        <p><b>n/serverinfo</b> — Show server info</p>
        <p><b>n/serverbanner</b> — Show the server banner</p>
        <p><b>n/avatar @user</b> — View avatar</p>
        <p><b>n/ping</b> — Show latency</p>
        <p><b>n/time</b> — Current UTC time</p>
        <p><b>n/invite</b> — Get bot invite link</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>☻ Fun & Games</h2>
        <p><b>n/hug @user</b> — Hug someone</p>
        <p><b>n/hugall</b> — Hug everyone</p>
        <p><b>n/kiss @user</b> — Kiss someone</p>
        <p><b>n/flipcoin</b> — Flip a coin</p>
        <p><b>n/roll &lt;sides&gt;</b> — Roll a dice</p>
        <p><b>n/8ball &lt;question&gt;</b> — Magic 8-ball</p>
        <p><b>n/meme</b> — Random meme</p>
        <p><b>n/rps &lt;rock/paper/scissors&gt;</b> — Rock Paper Scissors</p>
        <p><b>n/tictactoe @opponent</b> — Start Tic Tac Toe</p>
        <p><b>n/connect4 @opponent</b> — Play Connect 4</p>
        <p><b>n/rpg</b> — Text RPG adventure</p>
        <p><b>n/spellduel @opponent</b> — Spell duel</p>
        <p><b>n/wordchain &lt;word&gt;</b> — Start a word chain</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>⚡︎ Utility</h2>
        <p><b>n/say &lt;message&gt;</b> — Repeat message</p>
        <p><b>n/poll "question" &lt;option1&gt; &lt;option2&gt; [time]</b> — Create a poll</p>
        <p><b>n/announce &lt;message&gt;</b> — Make announcement</p>
        <p><b>n/ask &lt;question&gt;</b> — Ask OpenAI</p>
        <p><b>n/define &lt;word&gt;</b> — Get word definition</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
